{"id":"miteinander","lemma":"miteinander","pos":"adv","rank":852,"glosses":["together (with)","with each other"],"ipa":"/ˌmɪt.(ʔ)aɪ̯ˈnan.dɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1c/De-miteinander.ogg/De-miteinander.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wir essen miteinander.","en":"We eat together.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to eat"},null]},{"text":"Können wir hier miteinander reden?","en":"Can we talk here?","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"to talk"}]},{"text":"Ich denke, wir müssen miteinander reden.","en":"I think we need to have a talk.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},null,{"g":"to talk"}]},{"text":"Sie verbringen viel Zeit miteinander.","en":"They spend a lot of time together.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to spend, to pass"},{"g":"much, a lot"},{"g":"time"},null]},{"text":"Wir sprechen nicht miteinander.","en":"We're not speaking to each other.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to speak"},{"g":"not"},null]}]}